  "body": "Deadline Sale: Wednesday 18th November @ 4pm (USP)\r\n\r\nSet in a spectacular absolute clifftop position, 89 Tiri Road offers breathtaking coastal views and an exciting opportunity to secure a special piece of real estate in a sought-after coastal location. Positioned within easy reach of Matakatia, Tindalls Beach and Little and Big Manly beaches, this property enjoys the best of the surrounding coastal lifestyle. Sitting on a generous 1,062m² site, it offers plenty of charm and potential.\r\n\r\nThis original 1950s two-bedroom Kiwi bach, complete with a separate Sleepout or could be used as a storage area, is full of classic Kiwi bach charm. Enjoy an exquisite panorama across the sparkling Hauraki Gulf towards Frenchmans Cap (Kotanui island), the Noises and Waiheke and the Coromandel beyond with stunning sunrises and sunsets and the pleasure of watching the Gulf Harbour Ferry, boats cruise across the gulf and at night the Tiri Tiri lighthouse.\r\n\r\nLovingly cherished by the vendors for the past 18 years, this much-loved property is now ready for its next chapter. Offered vacant and ready to move in, you can enjoy the bach as it stands or explore the exciting potential of building your dream home and making the most of this spectacular clifftop position.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by beautiful beaches and within easy walking distance of Manly Village, you'll find a great selection of local shops, restaurants, cafés and everyday amenities close by. A golf course and the local marina are also nearby, adding to the appeal of this sought-after coastal location.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a classic Kiwi bach to enjoy, a coastal investment or the perfect position for your dream home, 89 Tiri Road is a property well worth your attention.\r\n\r\nCall Lane today to arrange a private viewing, or he looks forward to\r\nwelcoming you at the next open home.\r\n\r\nAll agents are welcome for conjunctional sale.\r\n\r\nTo view/download property files please copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/E2XU",
